{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj41yowknZRP5ygj7a6k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am a door. Simple. Wooden. Old.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center — tarnished brass, cold to the touch. Scratch marks surround it where others have tried and failed.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*The question is: which key? I have felt thousands pressed against my lips. Most do not fit. Some fit but do not turn. And a rare few...*\n\n*Insert it.*\n\n*I am waiting. I have always been waiting.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":121,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}